The consensus was that Jon Forrest document was still of current for
DU 4.0B - Thanks for the confirmation. Last weekend we took the plunge
and upgraded our cluster.

2 of us took them all ( 45 systems) down at 5:00pm friday and all were
back up running 4.0B by 5:00pm Saturday. We booted each client off a
"custom" CD which NFS mounted one of the servers disks and then
restored a "standard" root partition onto the client.

