Thanks to Mikel Stous for providing me the solution.

Question:
I am having a problem using FTP.  It prompts for username , but not the 
password.  It seems assuming a null password.

Solution:
# ls -l /dev/tty
crw-rw-rw-   1 root     system     1,  0 Mar 19 14:57 /dev/tty

If it's not set to 666 then you will have multiple problems, including
ftp having your described behaviour and yppasswd dropping core.

