My original question was:=20

_______
How can I increase the maxuprc value for a specific user?
_______

Acording to the received answers, it is no possible to change the
maxuproc limit for a single user. The only option is to change
this limit to every user as this value is global for the whole system.=20


As "Knut Helleb=F8" <Knut.Hellebo@nho.hydro.com> suggested me,=20
I had to ghange this value for every user by inserting the=20
following entry in etc/sysconfigtab:

proc:
max-proc-per-user =3D NN

and reboot the system.=20

