Thanks to Magali.Bernard@univ-st-etienne.fr and labelles@mscd.edu for
politely pointing out this was already covered.  Turns out there's an
issue with Netscape's FastTrack server and DU, where you have to
disable its internal cache by putting the following line in the
obj.conf file:

Init fn="cache-init" disable=true

The server's been working fine for many hours, which it wasn't able to
do before, so I think this fix works for DU 4.0B as well.

Mike

