Hi Frank,

Using the Korn shell the following works for me:

print -n "^[]O21;${STR}^[\^[]O2L;${HOST}:${STR} ^[\\"

where:

${STR} is an env veriable init'd to whatever you want.
${HOST} is an env variable containg the host name

