Several times a day i got the folowing error:
 panic (cpu 0): kernel memory fault

crash-data files contains
  crash-data.7:  trap: invalid memory ifetch access from kernel mode
  crash-data.8:  trap: invalid memory read access from kernel mode
  crash-data.9:  trap: invalid memory read access from kernel mode
  crash-data.10: trap: invalid memory read access from kernel mode
  crash-data.11: trap: invalid memory ifetch access from kernel mode

Is this a known bug or have I check the hardware (bad memory) ??

Thanks for any help
 Uwe Siodlaczek



