To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: Problems with prot.h and acl.h in 4.0x
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078609810234

Hello Managers,

It seems that the include file acl.h has moved between 3.2x and 4.0x.

In 3.2x the file was in the OSFPGMR350 subset and was moved in /usr/include.

Now the file is in OSFBINCOM410 and is moved in /usr/include/sys.

