There are three methods:

1. iostat <devicename> <time>

	Example:  iostat rz32 rz17 5
	This will run iostat on disk rz32 and rz17 and will repeat it every 5
	seconds.
	
2. "monitor" will display the disks on the right side of the screen.

3. Plugging into the controller and running "run vtdpy" will also display the 
disk I/O.  Haven't had a chance to try this though.  NOTE: run vtdpy will NOT 
work over hszterm.

