The problem: When changed from base to enhanced security my osf machine
many accounts appear to be disabled.

The concesus from the replies

If an X-windows environment is available use XIsso program to restore the
disabled accounts.

The files holding the relevant infos are located at
/tcb/files/auth/?/userid (where ? the first letter of userid)

edit with any editor the file and if the problem is the number of
unsuccessful login remove the number from u_numunsuclog,

alternatively change the u_lock entries to u_lock@ on the accounts
that you want to unlock.

Thank you all

Pantelis Topalis

